When I wished it was literally anyone in the world, but him, some writer far away.
当我希望那是世界上任何一个人，除了他，某个遥远的作家。

01:02:46.789 --> 01:02:49.429
Australia, Thailand, the North fucking pole.
澳大利亚，泰国，他妈的北极。

01:02:49.429 --> 01:02:52.690
anywhere but down that long, echoing hallway.
任何地方，除了那条长长的、有回声的走廊。

01:02:52.690 --> 01:02:57.849
Even worse, news of the nascent film project had broken and now everyone was writing me.
更糟糕的是，有关新生电影项目的消息已经传出，现在每个人都在给我写信。

01:02:57.849 --> 01:03:00.739
Congrats, are you psyched?
恭喜你，你心动了吗？

